Cisco Packet Tracer Topology File Placeholder
Project: Demonstration of Distribution Layer Functions Using Cisco Packet Tracer
Topology: distribution_network.pkt

Notice:
To open and run this topology simulation:
1. Ensure Cisco Packet Tracer v8.0 or newer is installed.
2. Open this directory in Packet Tracer or replace this placeholder file with your saved .pkt file exported from Cisco Packet Tracer.
3. Network Nodes Configured:
   - Core Router (R-CORE-01): 10.0.0.1/30
   - Multilayer Distribution Switch (SW-DIST-01): SVI gateways 192.168.10.1, 192.168.20.1, 192.168.30.1
   - Access Switches (SW-ACCESS-01, SW-ACCESS-02): VLANs 10, 20, 30 with 802.1Q Trunking
   - End Devices: Student PCs (192.168.10.0/24), Faculty PCs (192.168.20.0/24), Admin Servers (192.168.30.0/24)
